  "hadith0": "\"Camallada Alle ugu jecel yahay waa kuwa si joogto ah loo sameeyo, xitaa hadday yar yihiin.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith2": "\"Marka uu ina-Aadam dhinto, camalkiisu wuu go'aa saddex mooyee: sadaqo socota, cilmi laga faa'iidaysto, ama ilmo suubban oo u duceeya.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith3": "\"Qofkii tukada labada salaadood ee qabow (Subax iyo Casar) wuxuu geli doonaa Jannada.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith4": "\"Alle ma eego muuqaalkiinna iyo hantidiinna, laakiin wuxuu eegaa qalbiyadiinna iyo camalladiinna.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith6": "\"Fududeeya ee ha adkaynina, bishaareeya ee ha nacsiinina.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith7": "\"Qofkii mara jid uu cilmi ku raadinayo, Alle wuxuu u fududeeyaa jid Jannada loo maro.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith8": "\"Sadaqadu hantida ma yareeyo.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith9": "\"Mu'minka xoogga leh ayaa ka khayr badan, Allena uga jecel mu'minka daciifka ah, labadaba khayr baa ku jira.\"\n— Muslim",
  "historyDayCompleted": "{completed} ka mid ah {total} ayaa la dhammeeyay",
  "settingsSchedule": "Jadwalka",
  "settingsAppearance": "Muuqaalka",
  "settingsAboutTagline": "Saaxiibkaaga diinta ee maalin kasta",
  "settingsRolloverSub": "Goorta maalintu dib u bilaabato",
  "hadith10": "\"Qofkii maalintii boqol jeer yidhaahda 'Subxaanallaahi wa bixamdihi', dambiyadiisa waa loo dhaafaa xitaa hadday la mid yihiin xumbada badda.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith12": "\"Qofkii akhriya Aayatul Kursiga salaad kasta oo fard ah kadib, waxba kama celinayaan inuu Jannada galo geeri mooyee.\"\n— Nasaai",
  "hadith13": "\"Hadal wanaagsan waa sadaqo.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith14": "\"Qofkii rumaysan Alle iyo Maalinta Aakhiro, ha ku hadlo khayr ama ha aamuso.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith15": "\"Qofka u adeega carmalka iyo miskiinka waa sida mujaahid Alle dartiis u dagaallamaya.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith16": "\"Inaad walaalkaa u dhoolla caddayso waa sadaqo.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith17": "\"Kiinna ugu khayr badan waa kan Quraanka barta oo bara.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith18": "\"Qofna ma cunin cunto ka khayr badan tan uu gacantiisa ku shaqaystay.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith19": "\"Alle waa Rafiiq, wuxuuna jecel yahay debecsanaanta arrin kasta.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "settingsAbout": "Ku saabsan",
  "settingsVersion": "Nuqulka",
  "settingsDeveloper": "Sameeyaha",
  "settingsSupport": "Taageero",
  "settingsRate": "Qiimee abka",
