  "hadith53": "\"Ha quudhsin wax kasta oo wanaagsan, xitaa haddii ay tahay inaad walaalkaa kula kulanto waji bashbash ah.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith54": "\"Kiinna ugu khayr badan waa kan ugu khayr badan qoyskiisa.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith55": "\"Qofkii habeenkii akhriya labada aayadood ee u dambeeya Suuradda Al-Baqara, way ku filnaanayaan.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith56": "\"Adduunku waa raaxo, raaxadiisa ugu khayr badanna waa haweeney suubban.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith57": "\"Saddex duco lama celiyo: ducada qofka sooman, ducada hoggaamiyaha cadliga ah, iyo ducada qofka la dulmiyay.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith58": "\"Qofkii hal mar igu salliya, Alle toban jeer ayuu ku sallaa.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith65": "\"Mu'minku waa muraayaddii mu'minka.\"\n— Abu Dawud",
  "hadith66": "\"Runtu waxay horseedaa wanaag, wanaaguna wuxuu horseedaa Jannada.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith67": "\"U celi amaanada qofkii kugu aaminay, hana khiyaamin qofkii ku khiyaamay.\"\n— Abu Dawud & Tirmidhi",
  "hadith68": "\"Muslimka ma gaadho daal, cudur, walbahaar, murug, dhib iyo walaac, xitaa qodax ku mudata, in Alle dambiyadiisa qaar ku dhaafo mooyee.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith69": "\"Ducada Muslimku walaalkiis ugu duceeyo isagoo maqan waa la aqbalaa.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith70": "\"Qofkii saddex jeer Alle Jannada weydiista, Jannadu waxay tidhaahdaa: Ilaahayow, Jannada geli.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith71": "\"Soonka ugu fadliga badan Ramadaan kadib waa soonka bisha Alle ee Muxarram.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith72": "\"Qofkii xajka guta oo aan faxshi ku hadlin dambina samayn, wuxuu u soo noqdaa sidii maalintii hooyadii dhashay.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith73": "\"Cumrada ilaa cumrada kale waa kafaarad dambiyada u dhexeeya.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith74": "\"Ku degdega camallada wanaagsan ka hor fidmooyin u imanaya sida googo'ooyin habeen mugdi ah.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith75": "\"Labada rakcadood ee Subax way ka khayr badan yihiin adduunka iyo waxa ku jira oo dhan.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith77": "\"Haddii aad Alle ugu tawakkali lahaydeen sida xaqa ah, wuxuu idiin arsaaqi lahaa sida uu shimbiraha u arsaaqo.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith78": "\"Qofkii booqda qof buka, wuxuu ku jiraa midhaha Jannada ilaa uu ka soo noqdo.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith79": "\"Faafiya salaanta, quudiya gaajaysanka, tukadana habeenkii marka dadku hurdaan — Jannada nabad baad ku geli doontaan.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith80": "\"Qofkii aan dadka u mahadnaqin, Alle uma mahadnaqo.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith81": "\"Xasad ma bannaana laba mooyee: nin Alle maal siiyay oo xaqa ku bixiya, iyo nin Alle xikmad siiyay oo ku xukuma kuna bara.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith82": "\"Qofku wuxuu ku jiraa diinta saaxiibkiis, ee midkiin ha eego cidda uu saaxiib la yahay.\"\n— Abu Dawud & Tirmidhi",
  "hadith85": "\"Qofkii wax uga taga Alle dartiis, Alle wuxuu ugu beddelaa wax ka khayr badan.\"\n— Ahmad",
  "hadith86": "\"Qofkii qariya ceebta Muslim, Alle wuxuu qarin doonaa ceebtiisa Maalinta Qiyaamaha.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith87": "\"Adduunka ku noolow sidii qariib ama socoto.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith88": "\"Qofkii u fududeeya qof dhib ku jira, Alle wuxuu u fududeeyaa adduunka iyo aakhirada.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith89": "\"Ajarka camalladu wuxuu ku xiran yahay niyada.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith90": "\"Ka digtoonaada malaha, waayo malahu waa hadalka ugu beenta badan.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith93": "\"Wada cuna oo magaca Alle xusa, waa laydiinku barakayn doonaa.\"\n— Abu Dawud",
  "hadith94": "\"Ma jiraan dad fadhiista iyagoo Alle xusaya, in malaa'igtu hareereeyaan, naxariistu daboosho, xasilloonina ku soo degto mooyee.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith95": "\"Addoonka cafiskiisa Alle wuxuu ugu kordhiyaa sharaf oo keliya.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith96": "\"Awrkaaga xidh, kaddibna Alle ku tawakal.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith97": "\"Arrinka mu'minku waa la yaab — arrinkiisa oo dhan waa khayr.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith98": "\"Muslimku waa walaalka Muslimka: ma dulmiyo, ma dayaco, mana quudhsado.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith20": "\"Qofkii Ramadaan u sooma iimaan iyo ajar-doon, waxaa loo dhaafaa dambiyadiisii hore.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith22": "\"Ducada u dhexaysa aadaanka iyo iqaamadda lama celiyo.\"\n— Abu Dawud",
  "hadith23": "\"Qofkii Alle u dhisa masjid, Alle wuxuu u dhisaa guri Jannada.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith24": "\"Safafka ugu wanaagsan ee ragga waa kuwa hore, safafka ugu wanaagsan ee haweenka waa kuwa dambe.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith25": "\"Soomku waa gaashaan ka dhawra Naarta.\"\n— Nasaai",
  "hadith26": "\"Qofkii tukada laba iyo toban rakcadood oo sunno ah, guri ayaa looga dhisaa Jannada.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith27": "\"Kan si fiican u akhriyo Quraanka wuxuu la jiri doonaa malaa'igta sharafta leh.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith29": "\"Sadaqada ugu fadliga badan waa biyo waraabin.\"\n— Ahmad",
  "hadith30": "\"Qofkii mu'min dhib ka dul qaada, Alle wuxuu dhib ka dul qaadi doonaa Maalinta Qiyaamaha.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith32": "\"Xishoodku waa qayb ka mid ah iimaanka.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith34": "\"Qofkii is-samirsiiya, Alle samir buu siiyaa.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith36": "\"Midkiin ma rumaysna ilaa uu walaalkiis u jeclaado wuxuu naftiisa u jecel yahay.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith37": "\"Quudiya gaajaysanka, booqda bukaanka, xoreeyana maxaabiista.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith38": "\"Qofka xoogga leh maaha kan ku guulaysta legdanka, waa kan is-xakama markuu cadhaysan yahay.\"\n— Bukhaari & Muslim",
  "hadith40": "\"Dhaha 'Subxaanallaah', 'Alxamdulillaah' iyo 'Allaahu Akbar' mid kasta saddex iyo soddon jeer salaad kasta kadib.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith41": "\"Dikriga ugu fadliga badan waa Laa ilaaha illallaah.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith42": "\"Laba nicmo ayaa dad badani ku khasaaraan: caafimaadka iyo firaaqada.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith43": "\"Ka faa'iidaysta shan ka hor shan: dhallinyaranimo ka hor gabow, caafimaad ka hor jirro, hodantinimo ka hor faqri, firaaqo ka hor mashquul, iyo nolol ka hor dhimasho.\"\n— Hakim",
  "hadith44": "\"Qofkii akhriya Suuradda Al-Ikhlaas toban jeer, Alle wuxuu u dhisaa guri Jannada.\"\n— Ahmad",
  "hadith45": "\"Salaadda ugu fadliga badan salaadaha fardka ah kadib waa salaadda habeenka.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith46": "\"Sadaqadu way demisaa dambiyada sida biyuhu ay demiyaan dabka.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith47": "\"Qaraabo-xiriiriyuhu maaha kan wax ku celiya; waa kan xiriiriya xitaa marka laga gooyo.\"\n— Bukhaari",
  "hadith49": "\"Qofkii cunto cuna oo yidhaahda: 'Mahad waxaa leh Alle i quudiyay tan oo ii arzaaqay iyadoo aanay jirin awood iyo xoog aniga iga yimid,' waxaa loo dhaafaa dambiyadiisii hore.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
